# GH issue #287: egress allowlist for the `agent` container's git/gh
# tooling - matched against the CONNECT (HTTPS) target host[:port], so the
# optional :443 suffix is included. Deliberately just these two hosts, per
# the issue's own decision - not github's broader domain family
# (codeload.github.com, objects.githubusercontent.com, ...), since nothing
# this repo's tooling does today needs them. Extend here (with a comment
# explaining why) if a future tool genuinely needs another host.
^github\.com(:[0-9]+)?$
^api\.github\.com(:[0-9]+)?$
